    <string name="kb_intro">The ZUNEX keyboard brings back Word Flow from Windows Phone 8.1: swipe across the letters to write, get suggestions and autocorrect in many languages, long-press keys for accents, and slide on the space bar to move the cursor.</string>
    <string name="kb_step1">1. Turn on the ZUNEX keyboard</string>
    <string name="kb_step2">2. Make it your keyboard</string>
